hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"911","'Abdullah ibn Mas'ud reported that the Prophet"
"912","Abu Hurayra heard the Prophet"
"913","'Abdullah ibn Mas'ud reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"914","'Alqama reported that 'A'isha used to go to children when they\nwere born and make supplication for them. She came to a child and removed\nits pillow and found a straight razor under his head. She asked about the\nrazor and they said"
"915","Anas reported that the Prophet"
"916","Hiba at-Tamimi related from his father that he heard the Prophet"
"917","'Abdullah ibn as-Sa'ib reported that in the year of al-Hudaybiyya"
"918","'Abdullah ibn 'Umar reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"919","Sahl ibn Sa'd said"
"920","Anas ibn Malik said"
"921","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"922","Ibn 'Abbas said"
